  "title": "Gaskets select only the standing wave and parity",
  "subject": "Which signed three-bit laws reproduce themselves on which level-k Sierpinski gaskets",
  "conclusion": "Of 1,168 signed three-bit laws, 68 are exact on some gasket up to level 12, and every one that persists is a rotation, relabeling or field twist of the Eisenstein standing wave, or linear parity at powers of two. The other 42 are single-level coincidences at levels 3 and 5.",
